OL,3,AAustralian MP who lost both legs in
OL,4,Aalleged car attack discharged from
OL,5,Ahospital
OL,6,
OL,7,FAustralian politician Helen Haines, who
OL,8,Flost both of her legs after police say
OL,9,Fshe was deliberately run down with a
OL,10,Fcar, has been discharged from hospital.
OL,12,FThe independent MP was struck outside
OL,13,Fher electorate office in Wangaratta,
OL,14,Fnorth-east of Melbourne, on October 19,
OL,15,Fin an alleged attack which horrified
OL,16,FAustralia.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
