OL,3,AAustralian MP who lost both legs in
OL,4,Aalleged car attack discharged from
OL,5,Ahospital
OL,6,
OL,7,FBrendan Nugent, 43, has been charged
OL,8,Fwith dangerous driving causing serious
OL,9,Finjury, intentionally causing serious
OL,10,Finjury and the federal offence of
OL,11,Fcausing harm to a public official. He
OL,12,Fis yet to enter pleas.
OL,14,FHaines, 65, has been discharged, the
OL,15,FAlfred Hospital said on Monday, after
OL,16,Ffour weeks and several surgeries which
OL,17,Fresulted in the amputation of her legs.
